{
  "id": 1540,
  "description": "# Welcome in Elites of None \n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n### 🌐Guild Network🌐\n\n🔸Main Guild: Masters of None🔸\n\n🔸Banished/Cursed Guild: Exiles of None:🔸\n\n🔸Alt Guilds: Seekers of None, Adepts of None, Elites of None🔸\n\nWe use the following Guild structure for Players to progress trough and provide a suitable Guild for every Player/Combat Level:\n\n🔸CL 1-40 -&gt;  Seekers of None🔸\n\n🔸CL 40-60 -&gt; Adepts of None🔸\n\n🔸CL 60-80 -&gt; Elites of None🔸\n\n🔸CL 80-100 -&gt; Masters of None🔸\n\nPlease join the Guild appropiate for you CL.\n\n\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n### ✅Requirements✅\n\n🔸Be Active🔸\n\n🔸Combat Level 60🔸\n\n🔸Participate in Raids🔸\n\n🔸Contribute to Challenges and/or Stockpile if possible🔸\n\n\n### 🚫Kick Rationale🚫\n\n\n🔸5 Days Guild Inactivity🔸\n\n🔸Rare to Low Guild Activity🔸\n\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n### ⚔️Raids⚔️\n\n➡️ 1 RAID EVERY DAY\n\n🔸Raid 1: Enchanted Oasis (Level 60) 18:00-18:43 (UTC+2)✅ACTIVE✅🔸\n\n⚔️ EVERYONE PLEASE PARTICIPATE ⚔️\n\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ \n\n### 📦Stockpile📦\n\nOnly contribute Logs and Bars. Currently we are looking to build a new component slot. Longterm Goal is to have 10K from every Resource.\n\nCurrent Material priority:\n\nLogs: Mahogany Logs, Mystic Logs\n\nMetal Bars: Chromite Bars, Mystic Bars\n\n( Every other Resource is obviously fine too )\n\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n###  📞Discord📞\n\nFor those interested here is a Discordlink for the Guild Server: https://discord.gg/qBBPgk8zyZ\n\nRecommended for:\n\n🔸Information and Resources like Tools and Calculators\n\n🔸Raid/World Boss/Shrine alerts\n\n🔸Take part in Decisions, shaping the future of the Guilds\n\n🔸Ask us Questions regarding the Guilds or Game there\n\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════",
